# aria-affect.env -- env bridge for the fear organ's telegram mirror.
# fear-organ.sh reads TG_TOKEN/TG_CHAT; the repo's telegram.sh
# exports AGENT_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN/AGENT_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID. This file
# maps the SAME values under the names the organ expects, so there is
# exactly one copy of the secret on the host (sourced from telegram.sh
# at install time; see knowledge/aria/systemd/README.md).
